---
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<dialog id="install-help" aria-labelledby="install-title"
  class="m-auto w-[min(92vw,28rem)] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-900 p-0 text-slate-200 shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-black/70">
  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 id="install-title" class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Install {SITE.name}</h2>
      <button type="button" data-install-close aria-label="Close"
        class="grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/10">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18" /></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Add it to your device and open it like a normal app.</p>

    <div class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <ol data-help="ios" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Open this page in <strong class="text-white">Safari</strong> (Chrome and Edge also work on iOS 16.4+).</li>
        <li>Tap the <strong class="text-white">Share</strong> button (square with an arrow pointing up).</li>
        <li>Scroll down and tap <strong class="text-white">Add to Home Screen</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong class="text-white">Add</strong>. The icon appears on your home screen.</li>
      </ol>

      <ol data-help="android" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Tap the browser menu <strong class="text-white">⋮</strong> (top right).</li>
        <li>Tap <strong class="text-white">Install app</strong> or <strong class="text-white">Add to Home screen</strong>.</li>
        <li>Confirm with <strong class="text-white">Install</strong>.</li>
      </ol>

      <ol data-help="android-firefox" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Tap the Firefox menu <strong class="text-white">⋮</strong>.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong class="text-white">Install</strong>, then confirm.</li>
      </ol>

      <ol data-help="safari-mac" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>In the menu bar, choose <strong class="text-white">File → Add to Dock</strong> (Safari 17 or newer).</li>
        <li>Confirm with <strong class="text-white">Add</strong>.</li>
      </ol>

      <ol data-help="firefox" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Firefox on desktop cannot install web apps yet.</li>
        <li>Open this site in <strong class="text-white">Chrome</strong> or <strong class="text-white">Edge</strong> and use <strong class="text-white">Install app</strong>.</li>
      </ol>

      <ol data-help="desktop" hidden class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Look for the <strong class="text-white">install icon</strong> on the right side of the address bar.</li>
        <li>Or open the browser menu and choose <strong class="text-white">Install MAB-APP</strong> / <strong class="text-white">Apps → Install this site as an app</strong>.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-slate-400">Already installed? Open it from your home screen, Start menu or app list.</p>
  </div>
</dialog>